      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1PE",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "receiving the result of your faith, the salvation of your souls.",
      "ko": "믿음의 결국 곧 영혼의 구원을 받음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "a11c1ad337296df518b6b68af0072fdbb508b8364fcc7c0d7ff87b020d0d69fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "172b6382c8c1ee6d8926feb6306a25f427f6276f45f2683422e01c0fa7f6c687",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "믿음의 결국 곧 영혼의 구원을 받음이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "172b6382c8c1ee6d8926feb6306a25f427f6276f45f2683422e01c0fa7f6c687"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1PE:1:10",
      "sequence": 30381,
      "chapter_label": "1PE 1",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "1PE",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1PE",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "Concerning this salvation, the prophets sought and searched diligently. They prophesied of the grace that would come to you,",
      "ko": "이 구원에 대하여는 너희에게 임할 은혜를 예언하던 선지자들이 연구하고 부지런히 살펴서",
      "source_text_hash": "454a7a594b251c8d6923092fba24e1a2dbf13127e647433b32fe7e1099b48d54",
      "translation_text_hash": "5a8580ec7bc8115562876f523def83506fa9b452703545bbb4f98d61aa4995df",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이 구원에 대하여는 너희에게 임할 은혜를 예언하던 선지자들이 연구하고 부지런히 살펴서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5a8580ec7bc8115562876f523def83506fa9b452703545bbb4f98d61aa4995df"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1PE:1:11",
      "sequence": 30382,
      "chapter_label": "1PE 1",
      "verse_label": "11",
      "locator": {
        "book": "1PE",
